description:
`content/reference-queue.ts`, called with the user's token:
- list unrated References for the site corpus;
- order them by P(accept) (best bets) or by reviewRecommended then uncertainty (needs my help), sharing the rule with `lib/reference-feed-ranking.ts` and `lib/needs-me-ranking.ts` (import them, never copy);
- give each item its display title, its dek (preview attachment) and its summary (metadata attachment, then the curation card);
- page lazily, keep the session small (ids plus a cursor).

Gherkin coverage against a fake GraphQL client: ordering, a missing summary, an empty queue.
